# Known acceptable findings — review before adding entries
# Format: CVE-XXXX-XXXXX  # reason: <justification>
#
# Instructions:
#   1. Add an entry only after confirming the CVE is not reachable in production
#      (e.g., dev-only dependency, fix not yet available, compensating control in place).
#   2. Include a comment with the reason and the date the exception was granted.
#   3. Re-evaluate entries on each major dependency update.
#
# Example (remove when adding real entries):
# CVE-2023-XXXXX  # reason: dev-only dependency, not reachable in production — added YYYY-MM-DD
